<title>FRANCE: Cerus, Valeo suspended limit-down.</title>
<headline>Cerus, Valeo suspended limit-down.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of French holding company Cerus and car parts maker Valeo were suspended limit down, a spokeswoman for the SBF French stockmarkets association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>She said trading would resume at 0945 gmt.</p>
<p>Cerus holds 28 percent of Valeo.</p>
